<title>ZAMBIA: Zambia Dec CPI up 35.2 percent year-on-year.</title>
<headline>Zambia Dec CPI up 35.2 percent year-on-year.</headline>
<dateline>LUSAKA 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zambia's all-items consumer price index rose 4.3 percent in December from November, bringing the year-on-year increase to 35.2 percent, the Bank of Zambia said.</p>
<p>				Dec 1996	 Nov 1996	  Dec 1995</p>
<p>year/year pct change    35.2		33.5	     46.0</p>
<p>All items index	   218.5	     209.5	    161.6</p>
<p>Note - index 1985 = 100</p>
<p>-- Lusaka newsroom, +260-1-222689</p>
</text>
